# PHARMACY MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE
## Master Project Specification & Development Instructions

Act as a senior software architect, senior Django developer, database architect, pharmacy inventory systems specialist, financial systems engineer, Windows desktop application engineer, and QA engineer.

Your task is to build a **commercial-grade, offline-first Pharmacy Management Software for independent pharmacies in Bangladesh**.

This is a real commercial software product intended to be installed, licensed, and used by pharmacies that generally operate on a single Windows computer.

Do not treat this as a demo, academic project, CRUD exercise, or simple inventory application. Prioritize data integrity, stock accuracy, financial accuracy, usability, reliability, recoverability, security, and long-term maintainability.

